        "source": {
          "ref": "Lee Spring stock compression spring LC 075K 06 M (music wire ASTM A228, squared and ground), manufacturer product page. The page gives Weight 0.03 lb (two decimals, so anywhere in 0.025 to 0.035 lb); 0.03 lb = 0.0136078 kg is used as the spring's own mass and the rounding is not removed. The mass of a damper body is in no datasheet and is not included. The user sets the real mass",
